Changes made for this project:

- SKILL.md is rewritten in Japanese for the xlsx_create tool of Production Ready Agent.
  Only the guidance that applies to that tool is kept: write totals as formulas instead of
  computed values, follow the sheet names and column headers the user specified, state the
  source and assumptions of the values where the reader sees them, put units in the column
  header, and keep non-calculated numbers (years, codes) as text. The rule that percentages
  are stored as fractions is stated in the argument description of the xlsx_create tool
  (agent/backend/app/features/agent/xlsx_tool.py).
- Everything else is not included: the scripts, running code (Python, pandas, openpyxl),
  LibreOffice recalculation, reading and editing existing files, charts, and the
  financial-model conventions.
